{
  "work_id": "pta-peshitta/job",
  "source_path": "pta-peshitta/Job.json",
  "source_language": "syc",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "94b3e844eea1d057",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His sons would go and hold a feast in each man's house on his day, and they would send for their three sisters and invite them to eat and drink with them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.1.17",
      "source_sha256": "03dc42c9a2e14523",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While he was still speaking, another came and said to him, “The Chaldeans divided into three bands, attacked the camels, and carried them away. They killed the servants with the sword, and I alone escaped to tell you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.1.19",
      "source_sha256": "31006471b69ce697",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“And suddenly a strong wind came from across the wilderness and struck the four corners of the house. It fell on the young people, and they died. I alone escaped to tell you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "25d84c7034d58781",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said, “Naked I came from my mother's womb, and naked I will return. The Lord gave, and the Lord took away. May the Lord's name be blessed.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.2.5",
      "source_sha256": "6ed65ab4c6c1725f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“But stretch out your hand and touch his flesh or his bones, and he will surely curse you to your face.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.3.9",
      "source_sha256": "99974e4b9a4e6a21",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May the stars of its dawn grow dark. May they wait for light, but let it have none, and may it not see the rays of dawn."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.3.13",
      "source_sha256": "8f46d998d35b774d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For then I would now be lying down in peace; I would be asleep and at rest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.3.16",
      "source_sha256": "3f5a746b5e454164",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or, like a buried miscarriage, I would not have existed, like infants who never saw the light."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.4.11",
      "source_sha256": "3961402d15e690a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The lion perishes for lack of prey, and the lion cubs are scattered."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.4.14",
      "source_sha256": "2973cc9c751bbde1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Fear and trembling came upon me, and most of my bones shook."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.5.7",
      "source_sha256": "2989fbc1f1d503f3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For a human being is born for toil, and birds lift their wings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.5.21",
      "source_sha256": "7b8092239064e645",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You will be sheltered from the lash of the tongue, and you will not fear destruction when it comes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.6.15",
      "source_sha256": "28a06c311aec9bad",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "My brothers have been treacherous like streams, like watercourses that pass away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.3",
      "source_sha256": "44b348661d8a2eee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For if someone wished to dispute with him, he could not answer him once in a thousand times."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.11",
      "source_sha256": "e1cad223964c86b4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, if he passes by me, I do not see him; if he moves around me, I do not perceive him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.15",
      "source_sha256": "18bab4ea30935bf6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if I were in the right, I would not answer; I would plead with my judge."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.21",
      "source_sha256": "4a3ac0fc99ecc4f8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I am blameless, yet I do not know myself. I despise my life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.23",
      "source_sha256": "46ae97dd3bf6a1db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If his scourge suddenly kills, he mocks the folly of the innocent."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.9.30",
      "source_sha256": "c2a388d53fa25385",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if I wash myself with snow water and purify myself by cleansing my hands,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.12.6",
      "source_sha256": "21b08a061f7093cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The tents of robbers grow strong, and those who provoke God are secure, because God is not in their hearts."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.12.7",
      "source_sha256": "6db74966684c4213",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But ask the animals, and they will teach you; ask the birds of the sky, and they will tell you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.13.16",
      "source_sha256": "1e0b6dacdbc8c505",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He himself will also be my savior, because a [?] does not come before him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.13.17",
      "source_sha256": "a7aaf4848e57e6f7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Listen carefully to my words, and I will state my declaration before you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.13.18",
      "source_sha256": "b3694d77fbf4b26c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, I too am presenting my case, and I know that I am in the right."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.14.10",
      "source_sha256": "fb6d62c519d43525",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But a man dies and decays; a human being wastes away and is no more."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.15.20",
      "source_sha256": "74e29bc1be6db4cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "All his days the wicked man exalts himself, and a fixed number of years is reserved for the mighty man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.15.31",
      "source_sha256": "916f38499dacf9b6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He should not trust deceptive falsehood, because his reward has become emptiness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.16.3",
      "source_sha256": "c894c4aa3b81038e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not distress my spirit with words. Even if you speak to me, I will not answer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.17.11",
      "source_sha256": "87dfb9fdad5740c4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They make days pass, frustrate plans, and destroy the hearts of peoples."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.18.13",
      "source_sha256": "6ec7ca9062f3aaeb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His skin will be devoured by force, and his firstborn by the might of the dead."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.19.17",
      "source_sha256": "bde8038b94fa8f65",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I became a stranger to my wife, and I begged my own son for mercy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.19.19",
      "source_sha256": "d4e8103d72421813",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "All those who gave me counsel despised me, and even my friends turned against me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.19.21",
      "source_sha256": "50e5bfc59fcee70e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Have mercy on me, have mercy on me, you my friends, because the hand of God has touched me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.20.6",
      "source_sha256": "03bda33dc85d9076",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Even if his height rises to heaven and his head reaches the clouds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.20.17",
      "source_sha256": "82aa7c10b3290b73",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will not see the branching rivers and streams of honey and [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.20.28",
      "source_sha256": "46feb32f982e442c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The foundations of his house will be exposed, and he will be dragged away on the day of wrath."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.21.3",
      "source_sha256": "39d1b1016d06cf9b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Bear with me while I speak, and after my words, mock me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.22.12",
      "source_sha256": "4dc48186e324e985",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look, God has raised the heavens; see how high the tops of the stars have been raised."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.22.16",
      "source_sha256": "b110512475562b94",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They were stopped at the river crossing, and they did not remember the one who established their foundations."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.22.18",
      "source_sha256": "ffd81e384e8636f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He filled their houses with good things, and the counsel of the wicked was far removed from them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.23.13",
      "source_sha256": "aa876ec0e4211d6a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he is in one of these; what will he answer me? What he himself desired, he did."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.27.3",
      "source_sha256": "49849ec6d0ece9a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For all of it is in me, and the spirit of God is in my nostrils."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.28.10",
      "source_sha256": "cc9127b859d3fc9c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "By his strength he divided rivers, and his eye saw every precious thing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.28.28",
      "source_sha256": "109f9c3957cb2e3a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to humanity, “The fear of God—that is wisdom, and turning away from evil is understanding.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.29.15",
      "source_sha256": "41df88cc09bd1b2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I was eyes to the blind and feet to the lame."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.30.12",
      "source_sha256": "72dfe2233404e640",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They stood at my right hand and tripped my feet; they obstructed me along the paths of their ways."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.30.14",
      "source_sha256": "dded737044f37327",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They will come like a great breach, and beneath the storm they will be shattered."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.30.16",
      "source_sha256": "2da70532f6c14b56",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now my soul is battered, and the days of my humiliation surround me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.30.22",
      "source_sha256": "a9bde905d09b153c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You lifted me up and set me astride the wind; you humbled me and made me suffer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.30.27",
      "source_sha256": "fd5b7e4aa8656b0e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "My insides were in turmoil and did not rest; days of humiliation came upon me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.32.8",
      "source_sha256": "08a15a5cbc028ead",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Truly, there is a spirit in a human being, and the breath of God gives them understanding."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.32.22",
      "source_sha256": "eb0df033f6532953",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For I know no shame, and soon my strength would carry me away."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.33.3",
      "source_sha256": "0007e9228d4e165d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "The speech of my mouth is upright, and the words of my lips are carefully chosen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.33.17",
      "source_sha256": "13b7123bc1cddb59",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "To turn a person away from his deeds, and he rebukes a man's body."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.33.21",
      "source_sha256": "f73b958d0a0b5c8b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "His flesh will be consumed by his fear, and the bulk of his bones will not be seen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.33.23",
      "source_sha256": "e42f34c62f24b813",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "If he has an angel who listens to him, one out of a thousand, he will show the person what is right for him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.35.2",
      "source_sha256": "d386fccd56b35065",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Did you consider this just when you said, 'I am more righteous than God'?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.35.13",
      "source_sha256": "dbd2f9691617f25b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "God does not listen in vain, nor does God praise him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.35.14",
      "source_sha256": "b939171ba114418e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Even if you say you will not praise him, plead your case before him and implore him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.36.5",
      "source_sha256": "848bc458e05ac79b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Look, God is mighty; he does not reject someone who is pure like milk."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.36.11",
      "source_sha256": "134e3e0573e568bd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "They will listen and obey, and they will spend their days in prosperity and their years in delight."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.36.28",
      "source_sha256": "6e65a9f08d8a5b07",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Which the heavens send down in season; the clouds shower it on people, and they rejoice greatly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.37.6",
      "source_sha256": "361675806263f0f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For he says to the snow, 'Become earth,' and to the rain and the heavy showers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.37.13",
      "source_sha256": "60ce5b09ae40d446",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Whether for rulers, or for the earth, or for the devout person found in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.37.17",
      "source_sha256": "26b0c8b2cc856c9a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Your clothes grow warm, and the earth grows still because of the south wind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.37.19",
      "source_sha256": "a7476f32dff143a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Tell me what I should say to him, and let us not hide because of the darkness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.39.6",
      "source_sha256": "f2253c83ece7e9fa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Who made the open country his home and the salt land his dwelling."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.39.17",
      "source_sha256": "0b1acc16c4da1e91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For God has made wisdom abundant, but has not given her a share of understanding."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.40.13",
      "source_sha256": "62fb7904b3dbc0f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Bury them together in the dust, and bind their faces in the ashes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.40.15",
      "source_sha256": "5750d4d3e895582e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Look at Behemoth, which I made along with you; it eats grass like an ox."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.40.18",
      "source_sha256": "65079b7a4fed1a24",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Its bones are strong like bronze and like iron."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "pta-peshitta/job#Job.41.2",
      "source_sha256": "2de4a050534f4ddd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "He will not retreat when he is roused; and who can stand before me?"
    }
  ]
}
